<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38332" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαρτ-ύω</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαρτ-ύνω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡν</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fit</i> or <i>fix on,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτίκ᾽ ἐπήρτυε πῶμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					8.447
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>prepare,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ γὰρ Ζεὺς ἤρτυε πῆμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					3.152
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄλεθρόν τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					2.443
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῖπνον ἐπηρτύνοντο</span>
			they <i>prepared them</i> a meal, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Cer.</u>
				128
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
